From 26358840765617897e304d8f3b4ab0e407a63c65 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zeron-nightly <zeron-nightly@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:54:54 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Plugins: the APIs a design plugin needs (#1392 at 6094319cb,
 onto main)

zeronsh/zeron#1392 at 6094319cb7905e993bf88652c5c6e3ad619d9a27, merged
onto upstream main as one commit. #1392's base is the frozen zeron/zgx;
main moved the same lines, so it conflicts there:

- apps/zgx/Cargo.toml: main's side (its windows-sys features, its deps),
  with every zgx rev moved from main's zeronsh/zgx d391ea72 to #1392's
  hoangvu12/zgx 24b35872 (#2110 rebased on zgx main d98f954d; kept on the
  branch nightly-design-24b35872).
- apps/zgx/ui/consent_fixture.luau: both main's "draft" and #1392's
  "fonts" permissions.
- apps/zgx/Cargo.lock: main's, updated by cargo for the new zgx source and
  zeron-plugin-db; Cargo.lock: zeron-plugin-db at the workspace's version.
